# Pairs with OriginAuthenticated. A new cross-cluster method is bound on the
# host without registering with the admitted-peer seam, and the interceptor
# lets unregistered methods through.
MODULE: ReceiverUnregisteredMethodUngated
TARGET: OriginAuthenticated
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a method bound on the host but not registered with the seam is served

--- FIND
HostMethods == PushMethods \cup SnapshotMethods \cup SagaMethods
--- REPLACE
HostMethods == PushMethods \cup SnapshotMethods \cup SagaMethods \cup {"GrantIntent"}
--- END
--- FIND
    IF m \notin Registered THEN "unimplemented"
--- REPLACE
    IF FALSE THEN "unimplemented"
--- END